Z||000018||Kelvin Vivian||12-23-2001||02:57 AM||||Looks like kbb doesn't take into account a "rareness factor"... <P>The 1987 SE 4-cyl (1 of 1401), 5-spd, 127,000mi is worth $1500.<P>The 88 GT (1 of 614 with T-Tops), 5-spd, 140,000mi is worth $3500.00. <P>I like to drive both cars and yet try to keep them in "new" condition, I love washing the cars, some go to yoga classes to find peace, I wash my cars and find peace  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  I do not drive the 88 in wet weather, and it stays garaged at my parents place.<P>For the 87 (my daily driver), I have a covered parking spot at my apt. and at work there's underground parking.  The sun doesn't get a chance to beat on the paint as much.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=0&courtesy=1"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=3&courtesy=1">     <BR>88 GT, 5-spd<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, 5-spd||||reg||12
